{"seq":3,"slug":"substitution-out-of-stock-pick-exception","title":"缺货替代与拣货异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/store-picking-packing/substitution-out-of-stock-pick-exception","wordCount":2681,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"缺货替代与拣货异常处理\">缺货替代与拣货异常处理</h1><p>拣货员走到货位，扫码枪提示「应拣 2 件」，货架上只剩 1 件——这是门店履约里出现频率最高的例外。它一次同时触发三个下游问题：这一行拒不拒、用什么替、由谁批准。这三个问题的答案链条有多长，直接体现在两个数字上：替代接受率（顾客愿意收下替代品的比例）和因缺货导致的整单取消率。把这条链设计短，是门店履约编排里回报最高的一处工程投入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念与异常分类\">核心概念与异常分类</h2><p>门店作业面上的「异常」不是单一对象，而是三类<strong>变更理由不同</strong>的事件，混在一起管理会导致责任和终止状态错位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>短拣与缺货（short pick / out-of-stock, OOS）</strong>：分配结果显示库位有库存，实物不可得。根因在库存准确率，处理链路要回到库存可见性模型（见跨章节 <a href=\"../store-promise-availability/store-inventory-accuracy-visibility-model\"><code>../1_store-promise-availability/1_store-inventory-accuracy-visibility-model.md</code></a>）；它之所以会成为拣货问题，是因为拣货行本身是从库存分配结果里生成的（见同章节 <a href=\"pick-task-wave-batching-model\"><code>./1_pick-task-wave-batching-model.md</code></a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>替代（substitution）</strong>：原始 SKU 不可得或不可交付时，用另一个 SKU 满足同一需求意图。它是缺货的<strong>一个</strong>出口，不是缺货本身。</li>\n<li><strong>拣货执行异常（pick exception）</strong>：与库存无关的执行偏差——破损、重量不符、临期、错放库位、散装称重无法按在线数量交付。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三类共用一条处理管线，但终止状态不同：缺货收束为「替代 / 退款 / 取消」，执行异常收束为「换件 / 报损 / 改库位」。把二者当成同一类，会出现「破损商品被当成缺货去触发替代推荐」这类逻辑错误。</p>\n<p>衡量替代对履约完整度的贡献，先定义填充率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Fill Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>fulfilled</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>ordered</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Fill Rate} = \\frac{\\sum_{i} q_i^{\\text{fulfilled}}}{\\sum_{i} q_i^{\\text{ordered}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fill Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5594em;vertical-align:-1.0206em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5388em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ordered</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fulfilled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0206em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>替代把分子中的「原始 SKU 数量」替换为「等价 SKU 数量」，因此它抬高填充率；但只有当替代决策正确时，顾客实际收到的品类才不变——所以填充率必须与替代接受率成对阅读，单独看填充率可以通过滥发替代品被刷高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类型</th>\n<th>触发信号</th>\n<th>典型根因</th>\n<th>终止状态</th>\n<th>时效敏感</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实物缺货</td>\n<td>拣货扫码/人工确认无货</td>\n<td>库存准确率、损耗、后仓未上架</td>\n<td>替代 / 退款 / 取消</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量不足</td>\n<td>实物少于分配量</td>\n<td>部分已被售出、拆零</td>\n<td>部分替代 / 部分退款</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品破损</td>\n<td>质检不合格</td>\n<td>搬运、次级包装</td>\n<td>换件（同 SKU）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临期或效期不足</td>\n<td>效期扫描不达标</td>\n<td>周转慢、上架失误</td>\n<td>换件 / 放弃该行</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代被拒</td>\n<td>顾客明确拒绝</td>\n<td>偏好、过敏、价格敏感</td>\n<td>退款 / 取消 / 改派门店</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>散装称重不符</td>\n<td>实重与在线量偏差</td>\n<td>无精确单位</td>\n<td>按实结算</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库位错放</td>\n<td>按索引找不到</td>\n<td>补货/回库作业失误</td>\n<td>寻货 / 报缺</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"替代决策-资格-优先级与顾客授权\">替代决策：资格、优先级与顾客授权</h2><p>替代不是「换个差不多的」，它由三层规则共同约束；缺任意一层都会在真实门店里出错。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层，资格规则（eligibility）——硬约束，不可协商。</strong> 它排除的是「法律或平台政策禁止替换」的商品：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>年龄限制商品（酒类、烟草、部分非处方管制品）通常禁止自动替代，需要重新核验年龄后才可交付；</li>\n<li>政府福利支付方式对可替代品类有专门规定。美国农业部食品与营养服务局（USDA FNS）的 SNAP 在线购买试点与 WIC 项目规则明确：福利受益商品不得被替换为非合格品（如不得用福利额度替代购买非批准食品），因此支付方式必须进入资格判定，而不是拣货员的自由裁量；</li>\n<li>过敏原与食品安全决定了替代品必须<strong>可核验其标签</strong>，而非靠商品名相似。欧盟《食品信息提供给消费者条例》（Regulation (EU) No 1169/2011）要求预包装食品标注 14 类过敏原；美国《食品过敏原标签与消费者保护法》（FALCPA，2021 年《FASTER 法案》将芝麻列为第九大过敏原）同样要求标注。这两条把「替代匹配」推到<strong>结构化商品数据</strong>之上——匹配必须建立在商品属性而非文本上；</li>\n<li>处方药、一次性医疗器械、婴儿配方奶粉（部分市场有专门限购/替代规定）同理限制自动替代。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第二层，匹配优先级（ranking）——在合格集合里排序。</strong> 可行做法依据 GS1 商品标识体系（GTIN 加商品层级与属性）而非文本相似度，综合属性接近度、价格偏差与库存可得性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>match</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>attr</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>avail</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{match}(s, s&#x27;) = w_1 \\cdot \\text{attr}(s, s&#x27;) - w_2 \\cdot \\frac{|p_{s&#x27;} - p_s|}{p_s} + w_3 \\cdot \\text{avail}(s&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.328em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">avail</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>attr</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{attr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attr</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是规格、口味、规格单位、品牌层级的加权接近度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>avail</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{avail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为目标库位可得性。价格项取<strong>绝对偏差</strong>而非「越便宜越好」，因为顾客对涨价和降级的反感并不对称：替代品单价显著高于原品时，多数零售商的策略是不溢价结算。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层，顾客授权模式（authorization）——决定谁批准。</strong> 这是设计杠杆最大的一层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>授权模式</th>\n<th>顾客体验</th>\n<th>替代接受率</th>\n<th>运营成本</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预选替代品（pre-picked substitute）</td>\n<td>下单时指定备选</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低（拣货无需等待）</td>\n<td>高频复购、订阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拣货时推荐 + 实时确认</td>\n<td>缺货时推送，顾客现选</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（阻塞拣货，等待响应）</td>\n<td>高客单、时效宽松</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无需确认（pick-best / auto）</td>\n<td>按规则自选，事后告知</td>\n<td>取决于规则质量</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低价值标品、生鲜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不替代（no-substitute / refund）</td>\n<td>缺货即退款</td>\n<td>—（不涉及）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>年龄限制品、处方品、福利品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>行业实践的方向是一致的：把授权决策从「拣货员站在货架前」前移到「顾客在结算前」。Instacart 的 Replacement 流程、Walmart 的 substitution preference、英国 Ocado 与 Tesco 公开的 substitution policy 都属于这一范式——顾客在购物车阶段就完成偏好表达，拣货现场只需执行。这不是体验优化，而是<strong>吞吐优化</strong>：实时确认模式会阻塞拣货员，把最贵的劳动力钉在等待上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拣货异常的处理闭环\">拣货异常的处理闭环</h2><p>异常处理必须有一个可追溯的状态机，每一步都留下「谁在什么时刻决定」的记录，否则替代纠纷无法复盘。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[拣货行扫码] --&gt; B{实物与分配一致?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[确认拣货完成]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[记录异常事件&lt;br/&gt;类型/库位/SKU/时间]&#10;  D --&gt; E{异常类型}&#10;  E --&gt;|库存缺货| F{资格规则通过?}&#10;  E --&gt;|破损临期| G[同 SKU 换件或报损]&#10;  E --&gt;|称重偏差| H[按实重结算]&#10;  F --&gt;|否 禁替代| I[退款或取消该行]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| J[按匹配优先级生成候选]&#10;  J --&gt; K{授权模式}&#10;  K --&gt;|已预选| L[直接采用预选替代]&#10;  K --&gt;|需实时确认| M[推送顾客并等待]&#10;  K --&gt;|无确认| N[采用最高分候选]&#10;  M --&gt;|接受| L&#10;  M --&gt;|拒绝或超时| I&#10;  L --&gt; O[更新订单与结算]&#10;  I --&gt; O&#10;  G --&gt; O&#10;  H --&gt; O&#10;  O --&gt; P[回写库存准确率与缺货信号]&#10;  P --&gt; Q[补货/安全库存/商品数据改进]\">flowchart TD\n  A[拣货行扫码] --&gt; B{实物与分配一致?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[确认拣货完成]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[记录异常事件&lt;br/&gt;类型/库位/SKU/时间]\n  D --&gt; E{异常类型}\n  E --&gt;|库存缺货| F{资格规则通过?}\n  E --&gt;|破损临期| G[同 SKU 换件或报损]\n  E --&gt;|称重偏差| H[按实重结算]\n  F --&gt;|否 禁替代| I[退款或取消该行]\n  F --&gt;|是| J[按匹配优先级生成候选]\n  J --&gt; K{授权模式}\n  K --&gt;|已预选| L[直接采用预选替代]\n  K --&gt;|需实时确认| M[推送顾客并等待]\n  K --&gt;|无确认| N[采用最高分候选]\n  M --&gt;|接受| L\n  M --&gt;|拒绝或超时| I\n  L --&gt; O[更新订单与结算]\n  I --&gt; O\n  G --&gt; O\n  H --&gt; O\n  O --&gt; P[回写库存准确率与缺货信号]\n  P --&gt; Q[补货/安全库存/商品数据改进]</pre><p>闭环的关键在最后一跳 <code>P → Q</code>：缺货事件不是处理完就丢弃的工单，它是库存准确率、安全库存参数和商品主数据质量的实测样本。缺失这一跳的系统，会在同一个货位反复缺货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"门店执行-标识-结算与合规边界\">门店执行：标识、结算与合规边界</h2><p>规则在系统里说得通，不代表门店里执行得顺。三处物理与财务边界值得单独设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理标识</strong>：替代品必须让复核环节能区分「原始行」与「替代行」。拣货筐分区、替代标签、以及「替代品与原品不允许混放同一隔仓」约束，是防止复核错单的常见做法。</li>\n<li><strong>结算边界</strong>：BOPIS 通常在<strong>取货时</strong>才对最终商品扣款（区别于纯线上单即时扣款的预授权模型）。替代导致金额变动时，取货环节需要重新授权，这是「取车交付」环节与替代逻辑的强耦合点——预授权额度不足会直接在取车现场造成支付失败。</li>\n<li><strong>税务与单位</strong>：部分美国州对特定食品免税，替代改变了品类就可能改变税额；散装称重品按实重结算。因此结算重算必须按<strong>最终实际商品</strong>，而不是按下单快照。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"度量与持续改进\">度量与持续改进</h2><p>替代与异常处理只能靠指标闭环改进，几个核心量的定义必须固定下来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OSR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>短拣行数</mtext><mtext>总拣货行数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>SAR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>被接受的替代数</mtext><mtext>发出的替代数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>MTTR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>resolve</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>raise</mtext></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OSR} = \\frac{\\text{短拣行数}}{\\text{总拣货行数}}, \\qquad \\text{SAR} = \\frac{\\text{被接受的替代数}}{\\text{发出的替代数}}, \\qquad \\text{MTTR} = \\frac{\\sum \\left( t^{\\text{resolve}}_i - t^{\\text{raise}}_i \\right)}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OSR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总拣货行数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">短拣行数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SAR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发出的替代数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">被接受的替代数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTTR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.276em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resolve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8305em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">raise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>诊断指向</th>\n<th>改进动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺货率 OSR</td>\n<td>短拣行占总行数比例</td>\n<td>库存准确率、补货</td>\n<td>循环盘点、安全库存上调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代接受率 SAR</td>\n<td>替代被接受的比例</td>\n<td>匹配规则与授权模式</td>\n<td>调整排序权重、前置预选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常平均处理时长 MTTR</td>\n<td>从上报到收束</td>\n<td>授权链路长度</td>\n<td>移除实时确认阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺货取消率</td>\n<td>缺货导致整单取消的比例</td>\n<td>资格规则过严</td>\n<td>放宽可替代类目、增加备选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代溢价率</td>\n<td>替代品高于原品的比例</td>\n<td>结算与信任</td>\n<td>强制不溢价结算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单独看任一指标都会被误导：把 SAR 刷高最省事的办法是「多推替代、少退款」，但那会推高顾客投诉；把 OSR 刷低最省事的办法是「系统假装有货」，代价转移到取货现场的失败。因此这套指标必须与门店履约的总产能指标（见第三章章节的产能与人工模型）联合阅读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>缺货替代与拣货异常处理是门店履约里<strong>决策密度最高、链路最短</strong>的一段：每一次货架前的判断都在消耗最贵的劳动力，因此它的设计目标不是「处理得完美」，而是「让拣货员不需要做判断」。达成路径是三层规则的叠加——用资格规则把不可替代的商品挡在决策之外，用基于结构化商品数据的匹配优先级把选择收敛成排序问题，用前置的顾客授权模式把「谁批准」从货架前移到结算前。执行异常则通过标识、结算与税务三处边界约束收束到可追溯的状态机里，最后把每一次缺货事件回流成库存与主数据的改进信号。判断一套设计是否成立，看它能否同时回答：<strong>哪些不能替、替什么最优、谁来批准、失败后如何收束</strong>——四个问题都能在系统里找到唯一答案时，门店作业面才真正被解除判断负担。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缺货替代与拣货异常处理","id":"缺货替代与拣货异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念与异常分类","id":"核心概念与异常分类"},{"level":2,"text":"替代决策：资格、优先级与顾客授权","id":"替代决策-资格-优先级与顾客授权"},{"level":2,"text":"拣货异常的处理闭环","id":"拣货异常的处理闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"门店执行：标识、结算与合规边界","id":"门店执行-标识-结算与合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"度量与持续改进","id":"度量与持续改进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拣货路径排序与分区分批策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/store-picking-packing/pick-path-sequencing-zone-batching"},"next":{"title":"到店地理围栏与签到模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/curbside-arrival-geofence-checkin-model"}}